## Testing

- ✅ **Syntax validation**: PHP and JavaScript code validated
- ✅ **Logic testing**: Comprehensive field population for all data types  
- ✅ **Backward compatibility**: Existing functionality preserved
- ✅ **Form integration**: All field IDs validated against registration forms

## User Experience Improvements

- **Better feedback**: "✓ Datos de empresa y representante encontrados y pre-cargados desde registros anteriores (3 registros encontrados, mostrando el más reciente)"
- **Complete pre-filling**: Users no longer need to manually enter company data they've provided before
- **Smart prioritization**: Most recent registration data is used when multiple records exist
- **Seamless integration**: Works with both company and guest registration forms

This enhancement significantly improves the user registration experience while maintaining full compatibility with existing functionality.

